VorteX — licensing scope

This repository contains separately licensed components.

* The existing VorteX framework (including src/, tests/, existing documentation and build configuration) is licensed under Apache-2.0 unless a file has a different valid license notice. The unmodified license text is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
* Original material specifically identified in studio/ is subject to studio/LICENSE (LicenseRef-VorteX-Proprietary), to the extent the respective rightsholder owns protectable rights. No license to redistribute proprietary Studio material is granted by the Apache license of the framework.
* Third-party materials remain subject to their own licenses and notices; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
* Existing license grants, statutory exceptions, and permissions under GitHub's Terms of Service are unaffected. This notice does not revoke any earlier grant or establish ownership.
* New components require an explicit scope and provenance review before publication.

See LICENSING_POLICY.md for the process. This is a source-available mixed-license repository, not an entirely open-source distribution.
